  "description": "Step into the cinematic world of Planet of Lana with the Supporter Pack, a heartfelt collection celebrating creativity, care, and imagination and inviting fans to walk a little closer beside Lana and Mui.\n\nInside, you’ll discover:\n\nDigital Art Book\nExplore the evolution of the game’s painterly world, from lush forests and tropical reefs to snowy peaks and makeshift cities, alongside characters, creatures, locations, in-game scenes, and concept art.\n\nLanguage Companion\nDiscover the game’s fictional language, learn basic phrases, gain insight into select dialogue while diving deeper into the lore of Novo.\n\nThank you for helping us bring this hand-painted world to life.",
